    "prompts/ops-conventions.md": "# Ops conventions\n\n- Inventory lives in `ops/servers.table.yaml`; keep `status` honest — alerts read it.\n- Anything with an expiry (domains, certs, licenses) goes in `ops/assets.table.yaml` with `renewal` as YYYY-MM-DD.\n- Incidents move across `ops/oncall.kanban.yaml`: Watch → Investigating → Resolved.\n"
